<section vertical-align="center">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item>
      <h2>Policy reaches value through physical systems</h2>
      <p>Move from policy to valuation only through a validated transmission chain.</p>
      <grid style="--marker-chip-padding: 0.75em" padding="1em" vertical-sizing="hug" spacing="none" marker-fill="true" marker-align="center" marker-position="above" marker-shape="chevron" marker-style="subtle" marker-size="large" marker="number">
        <grid-item colspan="15">
          <p role="eyebrow">Substance + asset</p>
          <h4>Policy scope</h4>
          <p>Identify the relevant substance, use and jurisdiction.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="15">
          <p role="eyebrow">Lifecycle</p>
          <h4>Operational constraint</h4>
          <p>Test equipment, servicing, supply and end-of-life handling.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="15">
          <p role="eyebrow">Value channel</p>
          <h4>Financial transmission</h4>
          <p>Test capex, maintenance, downtime, working capital and margins.</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="15">
          <p role="eyebrow">Action</p>
          <h4>Valuation response</h4>
          <p>Adjust only when exposure and timing are evidenced.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <aside variant="warning">
        <p>Unknown substance inventories reduce underwriting confidence before they prove financial loss.</p>
      </aside>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>